+# Traditional Chinese regeneration and save verification
+
+This work is isolated on `feature/zh-tw`, starting from checkpoint `1c8d243002fb4d36f2ef28e217e46f17235dff80`. The integration checkout is not edited by this worktree.
+
+## Regenerated source
+
+The canonical generator produces 255 native Chinese glyphs and 32 runtime translations. Regeneration changes only `src/script_menu.c`: starter/language string symbols and their definition order are brought into the generator's canonical form. The English/Chinese labels, language choices, four-starter order, menu IDs, selection logic and glyph data are unchanged.
+
+A second generator run produced exactly the same binary Git diff as the first. `git diff --check` passes. The complete native ROM builds successfully at 16,777,216 bytes:
+
+- SHA-1: `aa8c11175d22393e5f72f5ecde58943dc95d1989`
