+`taichung-city-contract.json` is the machine-readable interface for gameplay,
+localization, the visitor guide, and later transport. Coordinates are zero-based
+metatiles (16×16 pixels). Native map group 43 is appended; existing groups and
+map/layout identifiers retain their values.
+
+## Topology
+
+| District | Native map (group, number) | Size | Stitched origin |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Old city / arrival | `MAP_TAICHUNG_OLD_CITY` (43,0) | 40×72 | (80,48) |
